From: u463adea79e70f48f at groups.google.com (Matthijs Hollanders | Quantecol)
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:04:48 +0000
Subject: Re: Parameterizing nested hierarchy in survival model, fixed/random effects
Message-ID: <Pq5Qdn9QYjE.ye_EoPUvAAAJ@hmecology.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <Pq5Qdn9QYjE.bRr5FW8QAAAJ@hmecology.groups.google.com>
References: <Pq5Qdn9QYjE.SvlK9mEvBAAJ@hmecology.groups.google.com> <Pq5Qdn9QYjE.bRr5FW8QAAAJ@hmecology.groups.google.com>
